#!/bin/sh
set -eu
export DISPLAY=:0 XAUTHORITY=/run/remoteos/Xauthority
# The supervisor uses umask077. Its root-owned parent must remain traversable
# after dropping to UID600, while the per-user runtime directory stays private.
mkdir -p /run/user
chown 0:0 /run/user
chmod 755 /run/user
mkdir -p /run/user/600
chown 600:600 /run/user/600
chmod 700 /run/user/600
export XDG_RUNTIME_DIR=/run/user/600
export XCURSOR_THEME=Adwaita XCURSOR_SIZE=24
printf '%s\n' 'x-session-started' > /run/remoteos/graphical-status.tmp
chmod 644 /run/remoteos/graphical-status.tmp
mv /run/remoteos/graphical-status.tmp /run/remoteos/graphical-status.txt
xset s off || logger -t remoteos 'X screensaver control unavailable'
xset -dpms || logger -t remoteos 'X DPMS extension unavailable'
remoteos-cursor-info --initialize || logger -t remoteos 'Default cursor initialization failed'
/usr/sbin/remoteos-hardware-report /run/remoteos/hardware.txt >/dev/null 2>&1 &
# The root Xorg launcher drops privileges before executing all application UI.
exec su -p -s /bin/sh remoteos -c 'exec /usr/bin/remoteos-user-session'
